             blocked: "a generated deploy Makefile has an unchecked command, or real AWS or database work with no echo telling the person running it what is about to happen."
      # The fuzz sweeps run as two shards each, one CI job leg apiece, so the corpus is swept in
      # half the time. No unsharded row stays: no stage but `ci` ran the whole sweep, and a person
      # who wants one run of it types `hecks fuzz_run.fuzz --wait`. A shard is `shard=I/N`, and the
      # matrix legs of `checks_fuzz` and `checks_fuzz_sqlite` in ci-checks.yml number 1 to N, which
